Sensei used to live at her parents' place.

272
00:13:44,460 --> 00:13:47,260
Moving out alone must be really stressful.

273
00:13:47,260 --> 00:13:49,260
She's regressed to being a baby.

274
00:13:49,260 --> 00:13:50,660
Se… Sensei, 

275
00:13:51,750 --> 00:13:54,150
is there anything else you need help with?

276
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:55,560
We're neighbors, 

277
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:57,310
so feel free to ask me for anything.

278
00:13:57,310 --> 00:13:59,310
Well then…

279
00:13:59,310 --> 00:14:00,170
Yes?

280
00:14:00,910 --> 00:14:05,170
I haven't been able to
take a shower since yesterday.

281
00:14:05,170 --> 00:14:05,920
Huh?

282
00:14:06,310 --> 00:14:09,510
If you could wipe me down
with a cool towel, 

283
00:14:09,510 --> 00:14:11,210
I'd really appreciate it.

284
00:14:12,770 --> 00:14:15,110
But Sensei, 
you're not wearing anything now.

285
00:14:15,110 --> 00:14:17,100
That's a bit…

286
00:14:17,100 --> 00:14:19,110
Don't worry about that.

287
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:27,810
Because underwear hurts, 

288
00:14:27,810 --> 00:14:30,610
I've put on band-aids instead.

289
00:14:30,610 --> 00:14:32,610
ASSERTIVELY
So I'm not completely naked.

290
00:14:32,610 --> 00:14:34,000
ASSERTIVELY
I'm not embarrassed at all.

291
00:14:34,270 --> 00:14:36,190
That's a huge problem.

292
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:38,370
The pain from sunburn

293
00:14:38,370 --> 00:14:39,260
might have weakened

294
00:14:39,260 --> 00:14:40,970
WOBBLING
her thinking ability significantly.

295
00:14:41,310 --> 00:14:43,760
Sensei is suffering.

296
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:45,610
I can't refuse just because I'm shy.

297
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:49,070
I… I'll do it.

298
00:14:53,560 --> 00:14:56,060
Do… does it hurt?

299
00:14:56,060 --> 00:14:58,250
A little bit.

300
00:14:58,250 --> 00:15:02,900
But it's cool and feels so nice.

301
00:15:04,710 --> 00:15:07,020
If I smell sweaty, I apologize in advance.

302
00:15:07,010 --> 00:15:09,960
I've had the AC on, but…

303
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:11,610
N-no, it's fine.

304
00:15:11,610 --> 00:15:15,760
I did notice another scent
besides shampoo and soap.

305
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:18,230
But I don't dislike it at all.

306
00:15:18,610 --> 00:15:20,160
I don't mind it either.

307
00:15:20,870 --> 00:15:23,960
I… I suddenly feel embarrassed.

308
00:15:23,950 --> 00:15:25,950
Th-this will suffice.

309
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:26,570
PULLS

310
00:15:26,570 --> 00:15:27,070
Wait…

311
00:15:27,060 --> 00:15:28,100
Look out!

312
00:15:30,510 --> 00:15:31,800
S… sorry.

313
00:15:31,800 --> 00:15:32,670
STARTLED
It hurts.

314
00:15:33,310 --> 00:15:37,020
My body hurts, so please don't move.

315
00:15:37,020 --> 00:15:38,640
S… sorry!

316
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,700
Th-this is bad.

317
00:15:40,700 --> 00:15:43,150
C… can I move now?

318
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:44,860
Wait a minute.

319
00:15:47,010 --> 00:15:49,260
I… I'm feeling much better now.

320
00:15:49,860 --> 00:15:52,600
Please move slowly.

321
00:15:54,610 --> 00:15:56,600
What are we saying?

322
00:15:57,860 --> 00:16:00,060
You've been a huge help.

323
00:16:00,060 --> 00:16:01,520
Not really…

324
00:16:01,510 --> 00:16:04,410
If you feel unwell again, just tell me.

325
00:16:04,410 --> 00:16:07,360
Sensei, you don't have
my contact information, right?

326
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:10,360
Then should we exchange?

327
00:16:11,210 --> 00:16:12,750
Exchange contact information?

328
00:16:12,750 --> 00:16:14,910
HEART RACING
Isn't that too close for the teacher and student?

329
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:17,260
BEAMING
To make it easier for everyone to consult me, 

330
00:16:17,260 --> 00:16:20,010
BEAMING
I want to exchange with everyone in the class.

331
00:16:20,010 --> 00:16:21,410
BEAMING
Oh, so that's why.

332
00:16:22,060 --> 00:16:23,510
Th-that said, 

333
00:16:23,510 --> 00:16:25,660
I still got Sensei's contact information.

334
00:16:25,660 --> 00:16:27,360
Feels like we've gotten closer.

335
00:16:29,410 --> 00:16:30,610
THOUGH I DON'T REALLY REMEMBER

336
00:16:30,610 --> 00:16:32,310
I FEEL LIKE I MADE AN EMBARRASSING REQUEST

337
00:16:32,910 --> 00:16:35,180
6 AM
Good morning, Abikura-kun.

338
00:16:37,610 --> 00:16:39,910
Let's go do radio calisthenics.

339
00:16:39,910 --> 00:16:41,560
O… okay.

340
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:45,060
About the photography club's group chat, 

341
00:16:45,070 --> 00:16:46,060
PHOTOGRAPHY CLUB IS PARTICIPATING IN
you guys

342
00:16:46,060 --> 00:16:47,050
NEXT WEEK'S FIREWORKS FESTIVAL
chatted late

343
00:16:47,050 --> 00:16:48,000
REMEMBER TO WEAR YUKATA
into the night, right?

344
00:16:48,010 --> 00:16:50,580
YEAH. GOT IT. I MUST WEAR YUKATA TOO?
You still discussed the fireworks festival yesterday.

345
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:52,660
S… sorry.

346
00:16:52,660 --> 00:16:53,610
It's fine.

347
00:16:53,610 --> 00:16:55,410
You're high schoolers now.

348
00:16:55,410 --> 00:16:57,540
You decide yourself when to sleep.

349
00:16:58,010 --> 00:17:02,860
But summer break can
mess up your sleep schedule.

350
00:17:02,860 --> 00:17:05,410
Let's do radio calisthenics
and get some morning sun

351
00:17:05,410 --> 00:17:07,750
to reset our internal clocks.

352
00:17:07,760 --> 00:17:10,569
Too bad the others live farther away

353
00:17:10,560 --> 00:17:13,210
and can't join us.

354
00:17:13,210 --> 00:17:15,210
Th… thank you, Sensei.

355
00:17:15,810 --> 00:17:18,710
Mom, I'm here.

356
00:17:19,210 --> 00:17:21,329
- Watch me jump.
- Starting now.

357
00:17:21,950 --> 00:17:25,400
Got Sensei worried about us again.

358
00:17:25,410 --> 00:17:30,910
But I am a bit sleep-deprived lately.
It's good to have someone keep me in check.

359
00:17:30,910 --> 00:17:32,270
Even if Sensei has poor stamina, 

360
00:17:32,270 --> 00:17:35,970
- Radio calisthenics shouldn't be too hard.
- We start with the back stretch.

361
00:17:37,610 --> 00:17:39,260
W… wait.

362
00:17:39,260 --> 00:17:41,960
If she goes all out from the start…

363
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:43,120
LEGS GIVE OUT

364
00:17:43,110 --> 00:17:44,670
STAGGERING

365
00:17:48,810 --> 00:17:50,380
That's all for today.

366
00:17:50,390 --> 00:17:54,020
PANTING
Have a nice day.

367
00:17:54,010 --> 00:17:55,430
PANTING
She's exhausted.

368
00:17:55,760 --> 00:18:00,160
She fell behind by the fifth move.

369
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:03,350
Yowayowa Sensei is weak
even at radio calisthenics.

370
00:18:03,360 --> 00:18:06,310
It's… strange.

371
00:18:07,410 --> 00:18:08,070
I can

372
00:18:08,070 --> 00:18:11,200
FRONT AND BACK STRETCH
usually do up to the sixth move.

373
00:18:11,210 --> 00:18:12,750
FRONT AND BACK STRETCH
Isn't it just one move short?

374
00:18:13,110 --> 00:18:15,610
Is it because of the gap?

375
00:18:15,610 --> 00:18:17,710
Does radio calisthenics have gaps too?

376
00:18:17,710 --> 00:18:19,710
I can't accept this.

377
00:18:19,710 --> 00:18:24,110
I don't deserve the reward stamp.

378
00:18:24,110 --> 00:18:24,960
Don't say that.

379
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:27,210
Just coming here to exercise
is worth rewards.

380
00:18:27,210 --> 00:18:28,310
RADIO CALISTHENICS STAMP CARD

381
00:18:28,660 --> 00:18:30,160
Don't mind it, Henyohenyo.

382
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:32,120
You're looking scary again.

383
00:18:32,120 --> 00:18:35,160
There's always a chance tomorrow, 
Henyohenyo Sensei.

384
00:18:35,160 --> 00:18:38,860
Even elementary students
can tell she's not scary.

385
00:18:38,850 --> 00:18:41,100
Alright, dismissed.

386
00:18:42,410 --> 00:18:45,360
After saying I'd fix your sleep schedule, 

387
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:46,360
I have been exhausted after exercising.

388
00:18:46,350 --> 00:18:47,520
Sensei.

389
00:18:49,610 --> 00:18:52,410
I'll stay for special training.

390
00:18:52,410 --> 00:18:54,170
S… special training?

391
00:18:54,170 --> 00:18:55,330
For radio calisthenics?

392
00:18:55,810 --> 00:18:59,410
By the way, 
she's wearing sports underwear.

393
00:18:59,410 --> 00:19:00,860
She's really serious.

394
00:19:00,870 --> 00:19:02,970
Abikura-kun, it's your first time, 

395
00:19:02,960 --> 00:19:04,950
but you finished it all. That's amazing.

396
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:07,810
What should I do to be as good as you?

397
00:19:08,610 --> 00:19:10,260
Well…

398
00:19:10,260 --> 00:19:12,560
Don't force yourself
to keep up with the rhythm.

399
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:13,850
Just do it once.

400
00:19:13,850 --> 00:19:16,610
Take a short break before the next part.

401
00:19:16,610 --> 00:19:21,220
It might be best
to try to finish it for now.

402
00:19:21,220 --> 00:19:23,320
I see. I'll give it a try.

403
00:19:23,710 --> 00:19:25,720
RADIO CALISTHENICS AUDIO
Radio calisthenics, first exercise.

404
00:19:26,110 --> 00:19:28,560
We'll start with the back stretch.

405
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:30,250
Stretch your arms up from the front.

406
00:19:30,260 --> 00:19:33,330
Then lower them to your sides.

407
00:19:33,710 --> 00:19:35,710
PANTING
That's it. Just do it once.

408
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:37,030
PANTING
Now take a break.

409
00:19:37,310 --> 00:19:38,920
Next is the arm and leg exercise.

410
00:19:38,910 --> 00:19:41,700
Bend and stretch your legs properly.

411
00:19:41,710 --> 00:19:43,600
PANTING
Do it once and then rest.

412
00:19:44,060 --> 00:19:46,590
Looking good. She's holding on.

413
00:19:47,010 --> 00:19:48,810
During every break, 

414
00:19:48,810 --> 00:19:51,160
Sensei looks happy
with her accomplishment.

415
00:19:51,160 --> 00:19:52,670
It makes me so happy to see that.

416
00:19:52,670 --> 00:19:55,010
Even if it's just once, 
I managed to do it.

417
00:19:55,010 --> 00:19:58,320
But her fatigue is gradually building up.

418
00:19:58,910 --> 00:20:01,430
Just one last move to go. Hang in there!

419
00:20:01,810 --> 00:20:03,860
RADIO CALISTHENICS AUDIO
Next is the jumping exercise.

420
00:20:04,260 --> 00:20:06,110
The toughest part is here.

421
00:20:09,510 --> 00:20:10,560
DIZZY

422
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:12,320
I can't go on.

423
00:20:16,510 --> 00:20:18,860
You're fine. Keep going.

424
00:20:20,310 --> 00:20:22,210
RADIO CALISTHENICS AUDIO
Finally, deep breathing.

425
00:20:23,110 --> 00:20:24,910
That's all for today.

426
00:20:27,970 --> 00:20:29,980
I… I did it!

427
00:20:30,460 --> 00:20:33,900
This is the first time
I've lasted till the end.

428
00:20:33,900 --> 00:20:35,600
Sensei, that's amazing!

429
00:20:35,610 --> 00:20:36,620
If you keep practicing, 

430
00:20:36,620 --> 00:20:39,170
you'll be able to finish it all someday.

431
00:20:40,310 --> 00:20:43,020
Thank you, Abikura-kun.

432
00:20:44,220 --> 00:20:45,280
DAMP

433
00:20:45,660 --> 00:20:47,510
S-sorry…

434
00:20:47,510 --> 00:20:50,650
I… I sweat easily.

435
00:20:50,650 --> 00:20:52,670
SOGGY
Is it normal to get drenched like this?

436
00:20:53,010 --> 00:20:55,490
SOAKED
It looks like I've stamped you.

437
00:20:55,860 --> 00:20:58,280
A stamp from her…

438
00:20:59,010 --> 00:21:00,790
Now I'm even more awake.

439
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:01,670
SQUEEZING

440
00:21:01,670 --> 00:21:02,540
DRIPPING

441
00:21:02,540 --> 00:21:04,800
IT'S WRINGING OUT WATER

442
00:21:04,800 --> 00:21:06,550
CANDY APPLES, COTTON CANDY, OKONOMIYAKI

443
00:21:08,860 --> 00:21:11,710
Photography club is
heading to the fireworks festival.

444
00:21:11,710 --> 00:21:14,210
Today, we'll keep
pressing the shutter button

445
00:21:14,210 --> 00:21:16,710
to search for the best summer.

446
00:21:16,710 --> 00:21:20,480
Yeah! Festivals are so fun. I love them!

447
00:21:20,810 --> 00:21:24,260
We used to come here a lot
as kids, right, A-kun?

448
00:21:24,260 --> 00:21:26,250
I vaguely remember.

449
00:21:26,250 --> 00:21:27,510
Look at me.

450
00:21:27,510 --> 00:21:30,360
I bought this brand new yukata for today.

451
00:21:30,360 --> 00:21:31,510
Oh.

452
00:21:31,510 --> 00:21:32,670
Do I look cute?

453
00:21:33,410 --> 00:21:36,320
It looks pretty flashy.

454
00:21:38,660 --> 00:21:40,910
And you look super cool
in your traditional jinbei.

455
00:21:40,910 --> 00:21:43,070
She is way too innocent.

456
00:21:43,460 --> 00:21:46,310
By the way, why do I have to wear jinbei?

457
00:21:46,310 --> 00:21:50,500
You should have some awareness as a model.

458
00:21:50,860 --> 00:21:53,810
I want to capture your look too.

459
00:21:53,810 --> 00:21:56,010
S-Senior?

460
00:21:56,010 --> 00:21:58,120
A-Abikura-kun.

461
00:21:58,860 --> 00:22:00,220
Let's take some great photos

462
00:22:00,210 --> 00:22:02,560
at today's fireworks festival.

463
00:22:02,560 --> 00:22:04,650
S-Sensei.

464
00:22:05,510 --> 00:22:06,020
HEART RACING
